    "description": "VACANCY ANNOUNCEMENT FOR LIAISON OFFICER AND SALES PERSON MYMR Trading Plc. is seeking a motivated and customer-oriented Liaison Officer and Sales Person to join our team. The role involves Serving as the main point of contact between the company and other parts, handling government office visits and tax filings, tasks related to errands and banking as well as assisting customers in the showroom, promoting furniture and home products and supporting daily sales activities. As a liaison officer he/she combines strong interpersonal diplomacy with administrative and regulatory executions to perform assigned tasks and daily activities efficiently while following instructions, quality standards, and deadlines. Report progress clearly and flag issues or delays early. As a sales person, he/she also engages with customers, understand their needs, recommend suitable products, and contribute to achieving sales targets. Salary: Negotiable KEY RESPONSIBILITIES As a liaison officer: Serves as the main point of contact between the company and other parts. Maintains good relationship with stakeholders, partners and government agencies Gathers, organizes and shares important data and reports Representing the company in meetings, events and discussions. Handling government office visits, business license renewals and tax filings Manages, compiles, updates and maintains client contact database on daily basis. Performing bank deposits, handling company documentation and running official errands. Buying office supplies and ensuring assigned business tasks are completed on schedule. Prepares reports and keeps records of communication and transaction As a sales person: Greet and assist customers in a professional and friendly manner Understand customer needs Support the sales process from start to finish Maintain good knowledge of the products Assist in achieving daily and monthly sales targets Keep the showroom clean, organized, and visually appealing Support promotional activities and marketing efforts Handle customer inquiries Maintain records of customer interactions and sales activities",
